---
// src/components/bangalore/CommonQuestions.astro
---
<section class="py-24 bg-white w-full border-t border-slate-200">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-slate-900 tracking-tight">
        Common questions
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-6">
      
      <!-- FAQ 1 -->
      <div class="bg-slate-50 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 border border-slate-100">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">What do you need from me?</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-600 font-medium leading-relaxed mb-2">
          One month of payment reports, your order data, and the bank statement for that account.
        </p>
        <p class="text-slate-600 font-medium leading-relaxed">
          We will show you where to download each one.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- FAQ 2 -->
      <div class="bg-slate-50 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 border border-slate-100">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">Will you raise the complaint for me?</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-600 font-medium leading-relaxed mb-2">
          <span class="font-bold text-emerald-600">Yes.</span> We raise it with the order number and follow it up.
        </p>
        <p class="text-slate-600 font-medium leading-relaxed">
          These companies do reverse charges when there is no record that you agreed. Somebody just has to ask.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- FAQ 3 -->
      <div class="bg-slate-50 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 border border-slate-100">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">What if you find nothing?</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-600 font-medium leading-relaxed">
          Then we tell you your payments are clean. That is also worth knowing.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- FAQ 4 -->
      <div class="bg-slate-50 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 border border-slate-100">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">Is my data safe?</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-600 font-medium leading-relaxed">
          <span class="font-bold text-emerald-600">Yes.</span> Used only for your check, shared with nobody.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Final CTA snippet -->
    <div class="mt-16 text-center bg-slate-900 rounded-3xl p-8 sm:p-12 relative overflow-hidden">
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-500/20 to-teal-500/20"></div>
      <div class="relative z-10">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-black text-white mb-4">
          One month. One check. Free.
        </h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-slate-300 font-medium mb-8">
          Free for the next 20 restaurants in Bangalore.
        </p>
        <a href="#free-check" class="inline-flex justify-center items-center px-8 py-4 text-lg font-bold rounded-xl text-slate-900 bg-[#25D366] hover:bg-[#1DA851] transition-all hover:scale-105 shadow-xl shadow-[#25D366]/20">
          Get my free check
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
